  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "[Valve Index HMD and Controllers]\nWhile testing the 3.0 avatars, I found what I believe to be a bug with the avatar system. This was found using the Young Boy demo avatar (See picture).\nWhen you go into the dancing blend menu, you can blend between dances, but if you are doing this and you change into the jump/fall state which can be done by jumping or walking onto the ledge of the mirror of the test world and falling off, the blended animations break. I think what occurs is a bug in the animation state transitions,  and the masking of bones, which makes none of the dances play correctly. This is fixed by exiting out the dance menu and going back into it.\nVideo of Repro:\nhttps://youtu.be/O_DG8wBADb4",
